flowchart TB
  U[Task Requirement] --> W[Worker claim task]
  W --> C[Copy pinned commit to Workspace]
  C --> R[Retrieve relevant code]
  R --> A[Read-only Patch Agent]
  A --> P[typed unified diff]
  P --> V[git apply --check]
  V -->|valid| AP[apply in Workspace]
  V -->|invalid| FB[one correction prompt or FAILED]
  AP --> T[server-approved test command]
  T -->|pass| H[HANDOFF_READY + report]
  T -->|fail| F[FAILED + test.log]
